~ start
Mister Dam: [#dynamic_portrait=MisterDamPortrait][wave][rainbow]Hellooooooo[/rainbow][/wave]. Come to join my [wave]gameeeee[/wave]?
do GameManager.give_name_note("mister_dam")
- Can I ask about the rules first?
	Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][shake][color=green]Yes[/color][/shake]! Of course you can dear guest!
	~ explain_rule
	Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)]The game I'm hosting is: [wave][rainbow]Obstacle Racing[/rainbow][/wave]! Here are the rules:
	Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(false)][color=yellow]Rule 1[/color]: Use the arrow key, not the WASD, to control your mini car.
	Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][color=yellow]Rule 2[/color]: Avoid hitting other cars and reach the finish line to win.
	Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][color=yellow]Rule 3[/color]: The car will move down when you press the down button.
	do GameManager.give_rule_paper("mister_dam")
	Mister Dam: Do you [wave]rememberrrrr[/wave]? Do you need me to repeat [wave]againnnnn[/wave]?
	- Sorry, I forgot. Please tell me again
		Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][shake][color=green]No problemo[/color][/shake]! I will repeat as many time as needed.
		=> explain_rule
	- I got the rule, let me play.
		=> play_game
	- Yeah, but I don't wanna play anymore.
		Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][shake][color=green]No problemo[/color][/shake]! Have a nice evening!
		=> END
- Yes, please!
	~ play_game
	Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][shake][color=green]Excellent[/color][/shake]! Give me a [wave]moment[/wave] to setup the materials!
	do GameManager.map_manager.start_minigame("racing")
	if GameManager.last_minigame_won
		Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][shake][color=green]Very, very good[/color][/shake]! I hope you enjoyed the challenge!
	else
		Mister Dam: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][shake][color=green]Don't be sad[/color][/shake], dear guest. You can alway [color=yellow]try again[/color]!
	=> END
- No
	=> END
=> END